5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what the changeover actually costs us in time. Who else is checking the morning routine upstairs?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am checking the floor billing basis. We need to know the monthly cost before committing to any layout.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am looking into the drawn plan against the staff survey. We need to see if the layout matches what people actually complained about.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I am checking the sound meter readings and the physio's note. Comfort is the part of this decision nobody ever writes down, and I would like it written down this time.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I am checking the badge records and what the new joiners reported. I want to see how arrival times and overhearing shape who we actually talk to.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the floor billing is high, does that mean we should just keep the desks we have to save money?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Not necessarily. We need the exact monthly figure to see if the current empty desks are wasting budget, not just to avoid moving.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, cost is one factor, but fairness is another. We need to know who gets the window seats before we lock anything in.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, fairness is just another word for who gets the quiet. I’m checking the sound levels and chair settings to see what comfort actually costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, comfort matters, but I’m worried about who we actually talk to. I’m checking the badge records and what the new joiners reported to see how seating shapes our connections.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, fairness is good, but I need to know if the changeover eats my whole morning. Is the pilot floor data showing how long setup takes?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the pilot floor data is for you. I am focused on the billing basis to understand our fixed monthly costs before we spend more.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, I am checking the survey to see if daylight is the real issue. We need to know what people value before we assign seats.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, the pilot floor data is yours. I am focused on the sound and chair settings to ensure the physical space supports long hours.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
